                    137.0,
                    767.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. Any grievance concerning Section G.5. shall be placed into Step Two of the Grievance Procedure. The grievance shall be signed by the Senior Business Representative and Assistant Senior Business Representative.",
